                  "meaning": "Excuse me",
                  "context": "Get someone's attention, or apologise for a small thing.",
                  "variety": "ps-var-yusufzai",
                  "citation": "Transparent Language Pashto phrase resource"
                },
                {
                  "id": "ps-itm-24d7e6",
