                  "meaning": "What does this mean?",
                  "context": "You do not understand a word. Ask what it means.",
                  "usage_note": "One of the most useful things a beginner can say, and worth learning before almost anything else.",
                  "variety": "ps-var-yusufzai",
                  "citation": "Transparent Language Pashto phrase resource"
                },
